{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35161","headline":"诗品二十四则 委曲 · 司空图","name":"诗品二十四则 委曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"登彼太行，翠遶羊肠。\n杳霭流玉，悠悠花香。\n力之於时，声之於羌。\n似往已回，如幽匪藏。\n水理漩洑，鹏风翱翔。\n道不自器，与之圆方。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35161.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35161","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}